  "translation": "Kečč, deg wul-ik, d-tennaḍ: Igenwan ad ɛeddigh; si fel i yitran n El ad ssulineɣ asar-iw, ad qqimeɣ ɣef wedrar n temlilit, deg iẓeḍḍanen n ugafa.",
